        "Track energy flows",
        "Run operational simulations",
        "Validate optimization scenarios",
        "Detect anomalies early"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "2. AI Models Built for Heavy Asset Industries"
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        "Power plants",
        "Cement",
        "Refineries",
