        "Sugar & Ethanol",
        "Water Utilities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Industries Most Impacted by RTO Adoption"
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        "Power & Utilities",
        "Cement & Mining",
