      "type": "h2",
      "text": "The Future: Fully Autonomous, Self-Optimizing Plants"
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        "Auto-correct inefficiencies",
        "Learn from historical behavior",
        "Anticipate failures",
        "Balance energy in real time",
        "Maintain quality automatically",
        "Provide natural-language insights"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Conclusion"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The next decade belongs to autonomous, self-optimizing industrial operations. Real-Time Optimization is no longer optional—it is essential for competitiveness, sustainability, and resilience. Platforms like Visionaize combine RTO, Digital Twins, predictive analytics, and GenAI into a unified solution that helps industries lead the future of intelligent operations."
