        "Reduced downtime and improved productivity in Oil & Gas operations.",
        "Enhanced safety through real-time operational visibility."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "By integrating robot operations into its digital twin platform, Visionaize enables organizations to:"
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        "Train robots virtually before deployment.",
        "Monitor fleet health and performance remotely.",
        "Predict maintenance requirements to minimize downtime.",
        "Optimize energy and material usage across robotic processes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "5. Use Cases & Business Benefits"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The combination of robots and digital twins delivers measurable improvements across industrial operations."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Use Case",
        "Robots Alone",
        "With Digital Twin"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Assembly Training",
          "On-site trial and error",
          "Virtual simulation with faster ramp-up"
        ],
        [
          "Predictive Maintenance",
          "Routine checks and unexpected breakdowns",
          "Sensor-based alerts and planned servicing before failure"
        ],
        [
          "Process Optimization",
          "Manual adjustments",
          "Simulation of speed, waste, and energy optimization"
        ],
        [
          "Safety Management",
          "Isolated safety zones",
          "Virtual hazard modeling before deployment"
