    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "What Is Remote Performance Monitoring?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Remote performance monitoring uses real-time operational data, advanced analytics, and connected technologies to continuously track the health and performance of industrial assets. This enables teams to detect inefficiencies, predict equipment failures, and optimize operations from virtually anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Why It Matters"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Traditional monitoring often depends on manual inspections and delayed reporting, making it difficult to react quickly. Remote monitoring replaces these limitations with continuous visibility, allowing organizations to improve reliability, reduce operational costs, and make faster, data-driven decisions."
    },
